2026-03-02 02:02:14,283 - src.sim - INFO - Patient: I think it would be a small gift to myself or a nice meal.
2026-03-02 02:02:14,890 - src.sim - INFO - Doctor: A small gift or meal can be a quiet celebration of your effort. How might you plan one of those rewards in a way that feels intentional, like scheduling it after a study session or a quiet day?
2026-03-02 02:02:19,471 - src.sim - INFO - Patient: I think I'll give myself permission to treat myself to something nice when I feel like it, without feeling guilty.
