2026-03-02 02:02:24,720 - src.sim - INFO - Doctor: That’s a strong and empowering mindset. By staying grounded in your choices, you maintain agency even when emotions rise. What’s one small action you can take right now to honor that focus—like pausing to breathe or writing one thing you did well?
