2026-03-02 02:03:50,673 - src.sim - INFO - Patient: I think I'll try to focus on what I can control and ask for help when I need it.
2026-03-02 02:03:51,476 - src.sim - INFO - Doctor: That’s a clear, compassionate, and empowering approach. By staying grounded in your control and knowing when to reach out, you’re building both strength and connection. What might one small moment today look like where you choose to ask for support—without fear?
2026-03-02 02:03:56,771 - src.sim - INFO - Patient: I think I'll ask my cousin for advice on what to do in the future.
