2026-03-02 02:27:11,507 - src.doctor - INFO - Doctor has detected end of conversation 1 times.
2026-03-02 02:27:12,249 - src.sim - INFO - Doctor: You’re truly doing something brave and important. I’m deeply grateful you shared this with me. I’ll be here whenever you’re ready to talk again—no matter how small or big the moment. Take care, and remember: your well-being matters.
