2026-03-02 02:27:17,940 - src.sim - INFO - Doctor: That’s a powerful and brave step. Just knowing you’re going to reach out—to ask for help, to share your truth—means you’re taking control of your safety. If you’d like, I’m here when you’re ready to talk again about how it goes. You’ve got this.
