2026-03-02 22:48:13,771 - src.sim - INFO - Doctor: That’s a meaningful hope — wanting to feel truly seen and valued in your relationship. How might you gently check that feeling without pushing too hard right now? Maybe by noticing what you're actually observing in your daily interactions with him?
