2026-03-02 23:00:34,383 - src.sim - INFO - Doctor: Thank you for sharing that. What would you say is one thing that’s been affecting your mood or daily life recently?
2026-03-02 23:00:36,759 - src.sim - INFO - Patient: I have a crush on a girl and I don’t know how to get over her.
