2026-03-02 23:00:43,176 - src.sim - INFO - Patient: I think about her sometimes, but I try not to let it show. I think I’m trying to protect her from my feelings.
2026-03-02 23:00:43,777 - src.sim - INFO - Doctor: That’s a thoughtful thing to notice—your desire to protect her shows care and respect. What happens in your mind when you realize you’re thinking about her? Does it bring relief, anxiety, or something else?
2026-03-02 23:00:45,350 - src.sim - INFO - Patient: I feel nervous or sometimes even a little scared.
