2026-03-02 23:00:48,823 - src.sim - INFO - Doctor: That’s a valid concern. But what if feeling those emotions doesn’t have to change the relationship—it might just help you understand yourself better? Would you be open to trying a small step, like noticing your feelings without reacting to them right now?
