2026-03-02 23:00:54,101 - src.sim - INFO - Doctor: That’s a gentle and wise choice. Keeping your thoughts private doesn’t mean you’re avoiding them—it means you’re honoring your space. Would you like to check in again in a day or two to see how that feels?
2026-03-02 23:00:56,144 - src.sim - INFO - Patient: Sure. That would be okay. Thanks for your help.
2026-03-02 23:00:56,722 - src.sim - INFO - Doctor: You're very welcome. Remember, you don’t have to figure it all out right now. Just being aware of your feelings is a step. Would you like to talk again when you’re ready?
