2026-03-02 23:05:05,261 - src.sim - INFO - Doctor: You’re very welcome. Wishing you peace, clarity, and gentle progress in your journey. Take care.
2026-03-02 23:05:06,814 - src.sim - INFO - Patient: Thank you! Same to you.
