2026-03-02 23:06:20,400 - src.sim - INFO - Doctor: That’s a thoughtful and kind balance—honoring your feelings while staying connected to what truly matters. Would it help to set a gentle boundary, like waiting a few days before reaching out, so you’re not rushing your peace?
