2026-03-02 23:06:41,050 - src.sim - INFO - Patient: Yes, I would like that.
2026-03-02 23:06:41,956 - src.sim - INFO - Doctor: Thank you for trusting this process. Carrying that phrase—“It’s okay to feel this way”—can be a gentle reminder that your feelings matter, and your worth isn’t tied to outcomes. How would you like to check in with yourself in a few days, just to see how you’re feeling?
2026-03-02 23:06:46,660 - src.sim - INFO - Patient: Maybe I could ask myself if I still feel the same, or if I feel more calm.
