2026-03-02 23:06:54,539 - src.sim - INFO - Doctor: Great. Returning to that question is a gentle and powerful way to track your inner journey. When you do, just remember: you’re not measuring success by how things “should” feel, but by how well you’re honoring yourself along the way. Would you like to set a specific time—like in a week—to check in again?
