2026-03-02 23:07:03,265 - src.sim - INFO - Patient: That would be nice.
2026-03-02 23:07:04,276 - src.sim - INFO - Doctor: Thank you for that kind and self-compassionate addition. “I’m doing my best, and that’s enough” is a powerful sentence to carry with you. You’re not just navigating this moment—you’re building a kinder, more patient relationship with yourself. How would you like to keep returning to this note in the coming days?
